text = "Welcome to Underville!
You play as a forager in a town trapped in a dungeon underground. You must collect enough resources by a certain day. 
You will start the game in the town.
You can talk to the NPC on the left side of town to find out how many resources you need and by what day.
You collect resources by interacting with the green resource points found throughout the dungeon. However, you can only collect resources from a resource point once per day.
To go to the next day, you can interact with your red bed in the town.
You can check how many you still need after you've collected some by talking to the left NPC.
You can enter the dungeon by walking into the brown door at the bottom of town.
In the dungeon, you will encounter skeletons, who will walk toward you and, when they get close enough, attack you.
You can either run away from them or try to kill them. Whichever you choose, be careful; if you die, you lose.
They will be there, waiting, right where you left them in whichever room.  Unless you kill them.
Your remaining health is in the top right of the screen.
The right NPC informs you how many rooms are in the dungeon.
Good luck!"
autowrap_mode = 2
